    <string name="qr_deposit_q">How do I deposit?</string>
    <string name="qr_deposit_a">How to deposit on Bpexch:\n\n1. Tap Deposit on the Home screen or the Deposit tab\n2. Choose your bank or wallet (Bank Alfalah, JazzCash, Easypaisa)\n3. Send money to the account shown in the app\n4. Upload a screenshot of your payment\n\nYour deposit is usually added within 2 to 5 minutes.</string>
    <string name="qr_withdraw_q">How long does a withdrawal take?</string>
    <string name="qr_withdraw_a">You can withdraw any time, day or night:\n\n• JazzCash &amp; Easypaisa: Under 5 minutes\n• Bank: 10 to 20 minutes\n• Fee: No fee\n\nJust open the Withdrawal tab and submit your request.</string>
    <string name="qr_account_q">I need help with my account</string>
    <string name="qr_account_a">For any account or payment problem, message us on WhatsApp or visit our official website.</string>
    <string name="qr_password_q">How do I change my password?</string>
    <string name="qr_password_a">For your safety, we change passwords only after checking your identity.\n\nPlease message us on WhatsApp from your registered number and we will help you right away.</string>
